mso-border-bottom-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;">
                    <p class=MsoNormal><span style="font-family:仿宋;mso-bidi-font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:12.0000pt;
mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;"><font face="仿宋"><p>This course introduces the principles of pharmacotherapy, clinical medication regimens, and pharmaceutical care for common diseases. Major topics include cardiovascular, respiratory, endocrine, infectious, gastrointestinal, and neuropsychiatric disorders. Through case-based learning, students will develop the ability to integrate pharmaceutical and clinical knowledge to evaluate rational drug use and support individualized pharmacotherapy.</p></font></span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-font-family:仿宋;font-size:10.5000pt;
mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;"><o:p></o:p></span></p>
                </td>
            </tr>
            <tr style="height:19.9000pt;">
                <td width=777 valign=center colspan=14 style="width:466.7000pt;padding:0.0000pt 5.4000pt 0.0000pt 5.4000pt ;border-left:1.0000pt solid windowtext;
